  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.4.6 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.4.5:\n\n- Keep a header's untouched nested values as written when the caller edits their mapping or list [patch] (#253) (matt-edmondson)\n- Suppress Polyfill shim drift in package validation [patch] (#256) (matt-edmondson)\n- Write Int128, UInt128, Half, BigInteger, nint and nuint as one scalar [patch] (#238) (matt-edmondson)\n- Keep a string the header wrote quoted quoted when the header is rewritten [patch] (#240) (matt-edmondson)\n- Write System.Text.Json values as the values they hold [patch] (#244) (matt-edmondson)\n- Read a header that holds a YAML tag, and keep the tag on rebuild [patch] (#245) (matt-edmondson)\n- Quote a TimeSpan and keep a dot in an exponent double's mantissa [patch] (#246) (matt-edmondson)\n- Write a value passed under two keys in full, not as a YAML alias [patch] (#248) (matt-edmondson)\n- Keep values a header already holds as written when the header is rewritten [patch] (#237) (matt-edmondson)\n- Insert a double or decimal into the header without dropping its comments [patch] (#236) (matt-edmondson)\n- Resolve only a plain \\<\\< as a YAML merge key [patch] (#232) (matt-edmondson)\n- Quote caller strings that read back as floats, = or \\<\\< [patch] (#231) (matt-edmondson)\n- Keep keys in input order when CombineFrontmatter merges them [patch] (#227) (matt-edmondson)\n- Give the caller-value serializer the invariant scalar converter [patch] (#226) (matt-edmondson)\n- Keep a body that opens with a rule passage out of the header in RemoveFrontmatter [patch] (matt-edmondson)\n- Drop the converter's unused read path to meet SonarCloud's new-code coverage gate (Claude)\n- Split ResolveMergeKeys and assert booleans directly, per SonarCloud (Claude)\n- Write DateTimeOffset, DateOnly, TimeOnly and Version values as one scalar [patch] (Claude)\n- Resolve YAML merge keys instead of returning a literal \"\\<\\<\" property [patch] (Claude)\n- Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into fix/188-quote-yaml11-lookalikes (matt-edmondson)\n- Quote caller strings that YAML 1.1 reads as booleans or numbers [patch] (Claude)\n- Keep the header as written when AddFrontmatter adds no new key [patch] (Claude)\n- Write the body after an inserted key as a rebuilt header writes it (Claude)\n- Merge main into fix/170-add-keeps-header-text (Claude)\n- Drop a null check the parse already rules out, and use AreSequenceEqual (Claude)\n- Filter the added keys with Where in TryInsertIntoHeader (Claude)\n- Insert added keys into the header instead of rebuilding it [patch] (Claude)\n- Keep the blank line that sets a body rule apart from the header [patch] (Claude)\n- Report a block with a complex key as unreadable [patch] (Claude)\n- Fold IsEmptyYamlDocument's three catches into one filtered catch (Claude)\n- Treat a header with no keys as empty so AddFrontmatter fills it [patch] (Claude)\n- Double-quote strings holding a carriage return or NEL so they round-trip [patch] (Claude)",
